eing moved off the main sickness and disability benefits</a>. The review, c=
onducted by the former health secretary Alan Milburn, has been in the works=
 for a year and plans to overhaul the welfare state and invest billions mor=
e pounds in employment support.&nbsp;</span>
</p><p dir=3D"ltr" style=3D"margin:0;font-size:18px;mso-line-height-alt:21p=
